# Scene-classifier regression fixtures live here — real screen captures from
# the game the integrating project is testing, kept out of the repo (same policy
# as task/templates/*.png): they carry account/build-specific content and are
# far too heavy to track.
#
# The framework's own tests (tests/test_scene_classifier.py) are fully synthetic
# and need nothing here, so a fresh clone runs green. Drop your captures under
# <label>/*.png — one folder per scene label your probes register — and calibrate
# each probe's thresholds against them; a probe measured on zero frames is worse
# than no probe at all.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.bmp
